# Frontend

UI copy is Russian. Routes live in `App.tsx`, pages in `src/pages`, shared presentation in `src/components`.

Server state goes through TanStack Query and `src/api/client.ts`. Do not duplicate OpenAPI types by hand. Local form state stays in React Hook Form.

Give every data screen a loading, empty, and error state. Show `error.message` from the API, not a stack trace. Buttons must call a real action.

Associate inputs with visible labels. Keep keyboard focus and button names understandable without color alone.

The access token, if used, stays in `sessionStorage`. Never put DeepSeek or Threads secrets in the bundle or in rendered text.

Client Zod schemas are convenience only. The server remains the source of validation.
